 :scenario/levers
 "Parameters worth moving one at a time to see which one the recovery is
  actually standing on. Each is a real procurement or staffing decision:
    dehumidifier_units        -- how much of the drying stock takes the mold door
    assessor_crews            -- the throughput of the certificate line
    volunteer_centre_capacity -- whether arriving labour becomes work
    temp_site_capacity        -- whether waste ends up at a site or on the road
    temp_housing_lead_days    -- how long people stay in a gymnasium"}
